  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WATC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance the psychosocial resilience of affected women in the Gaza Strip through the provision of daily psychosocial support and women-only safe spaces.Specific Objectives:Provide psychosocial support to 60 women from the most vulnerable groups.Establish daily safe spaces that ensure privacy and safety for women to access psychosocial support.Improve psychological well-being and strengthen positive coping skills among women.</narrative>
  </description>
